sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as React Login
    participant API as Express Auth API
    participant DB as MongoDB Users
    Admin->>UI: Enter email and password
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Find normalized email
    DB-->>API: User + password hash
    API->>API: bcrypt compare
    alt credentials valid
      API->>API: Sign JWT
      API-->>UI: 200 user + token
      UI->>UI: Store token in sessionStorage
      UI-->>Admin: Navigate to dashboard
    else credentials invalid
      API-->>UI: 401 invalid credentials
      UI-->>Admin: Show error message
    end
